language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit OperatorUiDomain.
capability OperatorInteraction.
functionality ProjectOperatorDomain.
functionality RouteOperatorIntent.
functionality ProjectAptAvailability.
functionality KeepMachineViewAvailable.

BuckingUI contains OperatorUiDomain.
OperatorUiDomain provides OperatorInteraction.
OperatorUiDomain status proposed.
OperatorUiDomain cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/UIDomain/DetailedDesignDiscussion.md".
OperatorUiDomain owns ProjectOperatorDomain.
ProjectOperatorDomain realizes OperatorInteraction.
ProjectOperatorDomain specifies "Adapt independent Machine/Bucking state into UI semantics via BWEB; keep business truth outside UI.".
OperatorUiDomain owns RouteOperatorIntent.
RouteOperatorIntent realizes OperatorInteraction.
RouteOperatorIntent specifies "Typed Presentation intent goes through command correlation and BWEB to the owning service, never direct widget mutation.".
OperatorUiDomain owns ProjectAptAvailability.
ProjectAptAvailability realizes OperatorInteraction.
ProjectAptAvailability specifies "Expose standard/version, common and extension fields and unavailable/unknown states; unsupported field is not zero.".
OperatorUiDomain owns KeepMachineViewAvailable.
KeepMachineViewAvailable realizes OperatorInteraction.
KeepMachineViewAvailable specifies "Retain Machine telemetry and virtual palette while Bucking is unavailable, visibly marking stale dependent data.".
